# Manifest Dread: "Manifest dread" (CR 701.62a). Its controller looks at the top two cards of their library, puts one onto the
# battlefield face down as a 2/2 creature (CR 708.2a, 701.40a) and the other into their graveyard. Cast on turn 1 with two Moxen
# ({1}{G}); the top two cards are Snapcaster Mage and Lightning Bolt and the player manifests the Bolt, so the card put onto the
# battlefield is the one chosen, not the top one, and the Mage is milled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Manifest Dread
Island x4
Snapcaster Mage
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x14

[Actions]
